#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:5
#: 2c6e38aaa1714ffab6428742e4146b0e
msgid "RC Transmitter Flight Mode Configuration"
msgstr "遥控发射机飞行模式配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:7
#: 59eda659a19c434aa99087c5264ecf1d
msgid ""
"This article shows how you can enable up to 6 autopilot control/flight modes"
" to be set from your RC transmitter via the flight mode channel "
"(:ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` for plane/copter/sub, :ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>`"
" for rover). Flight mode changes can also be made via RC channels setup as "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何通过飞行模式通道（Plane/Copter/Sub 使用 :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>`，Rover 使用 "
":ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>`）从遥控发射机设置最多 6 个飞控/飞行模式。飞行模式更改也可通过设置为 :ref:`common-"
"auxiliary-functions` 的 RC 通道进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:12
#: cd65067eabcc4d9aa5c9e47ac67b55db
msgid "Flight modes configuration"
msgstr "飞行模式配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:26
#: 1aa050a18d8c4ff08c7c9193a0e90925
msgid ""
"Flight modes are assigned to up to 6 PWM ranges for the "
":ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>`. This is done via the GCS parameter editor. "
"See :ref:`Sub modes<modes>` for the available operating modes."
msgstr ""
"飞行模式通过 GCS 参数编辑器为 :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` 分配至多 6 个 PWM 范围。可用的操作模式请参见 "
":ref:`Sub 模式<modes>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:30
#: bdd0ef4582e04cb89938fca43dfceba8
msgid "Setting the flight mode channel"
msgstr "设置飞行模式通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:32
#: 8662f33d4acc439a8dfd3cdee302cb59
msgid ""
"The flight mode channel is the input radio channel that ArduPilot monitors "
"for mode changes."
msgstr "飞行模式通道是 ArduPilot 监测模式切换的 RC 输入通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:39
#: a98bba21f31042ba88cffb19436d30a1
msgid ""
"By default, :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` is set to \"0\", disabling the "
"ability to select modes via RC, but can be set to any otherwise unused "
"available RC channel."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，:ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` 设为 「0」，禁用通过 RC 选择模式的功能，但可设置为任意未被占用的 RC "
"通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:42
#: f65ddfd4b0544f409abe4bf199edcf4c
msgid "Transmitter configuration"
msgstr "发射机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:44
#: 05732699e1854dc9885408dcf08e949c
msgid ""
"The transmitter must emit PWM signals in the correct range to allow us to "
"map a mode to a switch position."
msgstr "发射机必须在正确范围内输出 PWM 信号，以便将模式映射至开关位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst
#: d2de4f95ac7d49438f022fe36a98ad9e
msgid "Generally the range is between 1000 to 2000 us (1.0 to 2.0 ms)."
msgstr "通常范围为 1000 至 2000 us（1.0 至 2.0 ms）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst
#: 67ca28202dbd4f98a1f79e55a24bfd67
msgid "ms = millisecond"
msgstr "ms = 毫秒"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst
#: 910c2b1fd024492e84cdc2f7fae67d3b
msgid "us = microsecond"
msgstr "us = 微秒"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:52
#: a613f8fdfc4349a7aebcacd0424fc39e
msgid ""
"The correct PWM ranges for selectable modes are shown alongside each mode "
"selection dropdown in the *Mission Planner Flight Mode* screen (see "
":ref:`screenshot above <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration_flight_modes_configuration>`)."
msgstr ""
"可选模式对应的正确 PWM 范围在 *Mission Planner 飞行模式* 界面每个模式选择下拉菜单旁显示（见 :ref:`上方截图 "
"<common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration_flight_modes_configuration>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:56
#: b037586587064e1b8266b50f2901605e
msgid ""
"If you want to just support three modes (using a three position switch) then"
" you would configure the transmitter to produce PWM pulse widths of 1165, "
"1425, and 1815 us for the respective switch positions."
msgstr "若只需支持三个模式（使用三档开关），则需将发射机配置为分别输出 1165、1425 和 1815 us 的 PWM 脉宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:60
#: 8e3fae93fb3f42868e6db78fc574d178
msgid ""
"If you want to support 6 modes then the transmitter will need to emit PWM "
"widths of around 1165, 1295, 1425, 1555, 1685, and 1815 us. Typically this "
"is achieved by configuring the transmitter to mix a two position switch and "
"a three position switch (giving 6 modes in total). You can also do this with"
" an analog dial if one is available, but it’s hard to reliably turn a dial "
"to just the right position for six distinct settings."
msgstr ""
"若需支持 6 个模式，发射机则需输出约 1165、1295、1425、1555、1685 和 1815 us 的 PWM "
"宽度。通常通过将两档开关和三档开关混控来实现（共 6 个模式）。也可使用模拟旋钮（如果有），但很难可靠地将旋钮精确转到六个不同位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:68
#: 5ae883813deb4176a7e57fa2c9ce8575
msgid ""
"The sections below provide links showing how to configure transmitters from "
"different manufactures, and how to test (in Mission Planner) that each "
"switch setting is emitting the appropriate PWM signal."
msgstr "以下章节提供了各厂商发射机的配置说明链接，以及如何在 Mission Planner 中测试每个开关位置是否输出正确的 PWM 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:73
#: 62dd978a01b4403c880ccdf5efa60c3f
msgid "Test transmitter switch settings"
msgstr "测试发射机开关设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:75
#: be5b43441d154782bafe89d13886e4d9
msgid ""
"You can use the *Mission Planner Radio Calibration* screen to test the PWM "
"pulse widths for each mode setting."
msgstr "您可以使用 *Mission Planner 遥控校准* 界面测试每个模式设置对应的 PWM 脉宽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:78
#: 7887f8118b204441809ee3427be181ad
msgid ""
"Simply toggle through the modes on your transmitter and confirm that the PWM"
" for the selected channel matches the required PWM values. The screenshot "
"below assumes that the flight mode channel is set to Radio 5."
msgstr "只需在发射机上依次切换各模式，并确认所选通道的 PWM 值与所需值匹配。以下截图假设飞行模式通道设置为 Radio 5。"

